    "audit_date": "2026-09-20",
    "note": "Deferred from the executable catalog because substantial coefficient-refit discrepancies remain after the Seagle pressure reconstruction, protocol comparisons and thermal-correction diagnostics. Published equations and parameters are retained as source evidence, not accepted executable EOS. The exact combined pressure reduction and regression inputs remain unresolved; this does not establish that the publication is wrong. See docs/literature-reproductions/campbell-2009-mismatch.md.",
